cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: ephys-curate
abstract: 'Automated curation of spike-sorted Neuropixels and other extracellular recordings: a SpikeInterface SortingAnalyzer
  with waveforms, templates, unit locations and quality metrics, Bombcell''s rule-based labels and UnitRefine''s pretrained
  classifiers, combined into a final good / mua / noise label, written as an NWB Units table with spike times on the session
  clock, with figures and optional agreement with a reference sorting or ground truth. Pennsieve packages these methods; it
  did not develop them. Part of the Pennsieve systems neuroscience workflows.'
